    "name": "SAP API Management API Portal API Products API Proxies API",
    "description": "The SAP API Management API Portal API provides RESTful endpoints built on OData principles for programmatically managing API proxies, API products, applications, developers, policies, and key-value maps within the SAP API Management platform. Authentication uses OAuth 2.0 with credentials from the service key generated for the API Portal Access Plan. The base URL is tenant-specific: https://{tenant-url}/apiportal/api/1.0/Management.svc.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: SAP API Management Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
